msgstr ""

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1053
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>Every player on {server} sees this box</b> — or, with a coalition "
"chosen below, every player on that side. It closes by itself after the "
"server's configured message timeout."
msgstr ""

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1056
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The box is addressed to everyone on {server}, or to the one side you "
