msgstr "nichts gesetzt"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html
msgid "This saves to DEFAULT: every server that does not set its own value gets this."
msgstr "Dies speichert in DEFAULT: jeder Server ohne eigenen Wert bekommt das."

